lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Wei's photography works are unique. Today, he participates for the first time and carefully prepares his own organized photography exhibition. The exhibition displays his carefully shot works over the years. He stands in the center of the exhibition hall, proudly watching visitors appreciate his works.\n\n[Question]\nZhang Wei should feel proud at his photography exhibition, but why does he look anxious?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei worries that visitors may not like or understand his artistic style.\nB. Zhang Wei loses some important works before the exhibition, which makes him very anxious.\nC. Zhang Wei worries that the number of visitors to the exhibition is not enough, which affects his mood.\nD. There is a lot of noise at the exhibition site, which makes him worry that the audience cannot understand his works well.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249941088363064,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af582c39aa9dc5a833d25c7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794474691260,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:11:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8544c6544d04417cb85d97e255dcf179"}